{"seq":2,"slug":"opentelemetry-adoption","title":"OpenTelemetry 落地实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/foundations/opentelemetry-adoption","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"opentelemetry-落地实践\">OpenTelemetry 落地实践</h1><p>2026 年 5 月 21 日 OpenTelemetry 正式获得 CNCF 毕业状态，与 Kubernetes、Prometheus 并列。OTLP 已成为唯一需要关注的可观测性传输协议——Datadog、New Relic、Dynatrace、Grafana Cloud、Honeycomb 全部原生接受 OTLP。语义约定 v1 锁定（<code>http.request.method</code>、<code>db.system.name</code>、<code>messaging.system</code> 等属性名不再变更），日志信号 GA，声明式配置 1.0 稳定，Go 编译时插桩 v1 发布。标准化战争结束后，问题不再是&quot;用不用 OTel&quot;，而是&quot;怎么用好 OTel&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OTel 落地前需要区分几个易混淆的概念，它们决定了“在哪里配置、由谁采集”：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>落地位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Signal</td>\n<td>遥测信号类型：Traces / Metrics / Logs / Profiles</td>\n<td>三类 Provider</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTLP</td>\n<td>唯一需要关注的传输协议（gRPC 4317 / HTTP 4318）</td>\n<td>SDK → Collector 之间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Collector</td>\n<td>接收、处理、导出遥测的独立进程（非库）</td>\n<td>Agent / Gateway 部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Instrumentation</td>\n<td>产生遥测的代码：自动插桩或手动 API</td>\n<td>应用进程内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Resource</td>\n<td>标识遥测来源的属性集（service.name 等）</td>\n<td>OTel Resource 层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Semantic Conventions</td>\n<td>属性名与单位的统一约定（v1 已锁定）</td>\n<td>跨服务 Dashboard 的基石</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Declarative Config</td>\n<td>用 YAML 取代 OTEL_* 环境变量（1.0 稳定）</td>\n<td>启动时单一配置文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些概念的边界决定了配置的归属：Instrumentation 在应用内、Collector 在独立进程、Semantic Conventions 在跨团队约定层。混淆它们会导致“在应用里写采样逻辑”或“在 Collector 里塞业务代码”这类反模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"otel-架构全景\">OTel 架构全景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 应用层&#10;        A1[Go Service&lt;br/&gt;otelc 编译时插桩] --&gt;|OTLP/gRPC| C&#10;        A2[Java Service&lt;br/&gt;Java Agent] --&gt;|OTLP/gRPC| C&#10;        A3[Node.js Service&lt;br/&gt;Auto-Instrumentation] --&gt;|OTLP/gRPC| C&#10;        A4[Browser SPA&lt;br/&gt;OTel JS SDK] --&gt;|OTLP/HTTP| C&#10;    end&#10;    C[OTel Collector&lt;br/&gt;Gateway 模式]&#10;    C --&gt;|OTLP| B1[Tempo / Jaeger]&#10;    C --&gt;|Remote Write| B2[Mimir / Prometheus]&#10;    C --&gt;|OTLP| B3[Loki]&#10;    C --&gt;|OTLP| B4[Pyroscope]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 应用层\n        A1[Go Service&lt;br/&gt;otelc 编译时插桩] --&gt;|OTLP/gRPC| C\n        A2[Java Service&lt;br/&gt;Java Agent] --&gt;|OTLP/gRPC| C\n        A3[Node.js Service&lt;br/&gt;Auto-Instrumentation] --&gt;|OTLP/gRPC| C\n        A4[Browser SPA&lt;br/&gt;OTel JS SDK] --&gt;|OTLP/HTTP| C\n    end\n    C[OTel Collector&lt;br/&gt;Gateway 模式]\n    C --&gt;|OTLP| B1[Tempo / Jaeger]\n    C --&gt;|Remote Write| B2[Mimir / Prometheus]\n    C --&gt;|OTLP| B3[Loki]\n    C --&gt;|OTLP| B4[Pyroscope]</pre><h2 id=\"声明式配置-告别环境变量地狱\">声明式配置：告别环境变量地狱</h2><p>2026 年 3 月声明式配置达到 Stable 1.0。一个 YAML 文件取代数十个 <code>OTEL_*</code> 环境变量，跨语言行为一致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# otel-config.yaml&#10;file_format: &#39;1.0&#39;&#10;resource:&#10;  attributes:&#10;    service.name: &#39;order-service&#39;&#10;    service.version: &#39;3.2.1&#39;&#10;    deployment.environment: &#39;production&#39;&#10;&#10;tracer_provider:&#10;  processors:&#10;    - batch:&#10;        schedule_delay: 5000&#10;        max_export_batch_size: 512&#10;  exporters:&#10;    - otlp:&#10;        endpoint: &#39;http://collector:4317&#39;&#10;        compression: gzip&#10;&#10;meter_provider:&#10;  readers:&#10;    - periodic:&#10;        interval: 15000&#10;        exporter:&#10;          otlp:&#10;            endpoint: &#39;http://collector:4317&#39;&#10;&#10;logger_provider:&#10;  processors:&#10;    - batch:&#10;        schedule_delay: 3000&#10;  exporters:&#10;    - otlp:&#10;        endpoint: &#39;http://collector:4317&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># otel-config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">file_format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    service.name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    service.version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.2.1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    deployment.environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">tracer_provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        schedule_delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        max_export_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://collector:4317'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        compression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gzip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meter_provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  readers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">periodic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        exporter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://collector:4317'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">logger_provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        schedule_delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://collector:4317'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启动时只需设置一个环境变量：<code>OTEL_CONFIG_FILE=./otel-config.yaml</code>。Go、Java、JavaScript、PHP、C++ 已实现该规范，.NET 和 Python 在积极开发中。对多语言组织而言，这意味着一份配置模板即可统一全部服务的遥测行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多语言接入策略\">多语言接入策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>推荐接入方式</th>\n<th>零代码能力</th>\n<th>2026 亮点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>Java Agent（<code>-javaagent:opentelemetry-javaagent.jar</code>）</td>\n<td>完全零代码</td>\n<td>Spring Boot declarative-config 集成（v2.26.0）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td><code>otelc</code> 编译时插桩（v1.0，2026-07-16）</td>\n<td>零代码（构建阶段注入）</td>\n<td>覆盖 net/http、database/sql、gRPC、Redis</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td><code>@opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node</code></td>\n<td>零代码（<code>--require</code>）</td>\n<td>ESM 原生支持改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td><code>opentelemetry-instrument</code> CLI wrapper</td>\n<td>零代码</td>\n<td>声明式配置 in progress</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.NET</td>\n<td><code>OpenTelemetry.AutoInstrumentation</code></td>\n<td>零代码</td>\n<td>Profiles 集成 preview</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Browser</td>\n<td><code>@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-web</code></td>\n<td>需手动初始化</td>\n<td>OTLP/HTTP JSON export + context propagation</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Go 编译时插桩</strong>是 2026 年最重要的里程碑之一。Go 编译为静态二进制，没有运行时可 hook——此前只能手动插桩或使用 eBPF。<code>otelc</code> 通过 Go toolchain 的 <code>-toolexec</code> 机制在编译期注入 instrumentation，无运行时开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"go install go.opentelemetry.io/otelc/tool/cmd/otelc@latest&#10;otelc go build -o myapp .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> go.opentelemetry.io/otelc/tool/cmd/otelc@latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">otelc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"collector-部署模式\">Collector 部署模式</h2><p>OTel Collector 是遥测管道的核心。三种部署模式各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Agent（Sidecar/DaemonSet）</td>\n<td>每节点一个 Collector 实例</td>\n<td>K8s DaemonSet、VM fleet</td>\n<td>低延迟、可注入 k8s 元数据；资源分散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gateway（集中式）</td>\n<td>少量大实例集中处理</td>\n<td>跨集群路由、采样决策</td>\n<td>统一管控；单点风险需 HA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent + Gateway（分层）</td>\n<td>Agent 做本地处理，Gateway 做全局决策</td>\n<td>生产推荐架构</td>\n<td>兼得两者优势</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产推荐采用 <strong>Agent + Gateway 分层架构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>App</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>OTLP</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Agent (DaemonSet)</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>OTLP</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Gateway (Deployment, 2+ replicas)</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>OTLP/Remote Write</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Backend</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{App} \\xrightarrow{\\text{OTLP}} \\text{Agent (DaemonSet)} \\xrightarrow{\\text{OTLP}} \\text{Gateway (Deployment, 2+ replicas)} \\xrightarrow{\\text{OTLP/Remote Write}} \\text{Backend}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2948em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">App</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">OTLP</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Agent (DaemonSet)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">OTLP</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.397em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gateway (Deployment, 2+ replicas)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">OTLP/Remote Write</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Backend</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Agent 负责：本地 batch、k8s 元数据注入（<code>k8sattributes</code> processor）、Resource 规范化。Gateway 负责：tail-based sampling、跨服务的 <code>spanmetrics</code> 生成、路由到不同后端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采样策略-head-vs-tail-vs-混合\">采样策略：Head vs Tail vs 混合</h2><p>全量采集所有 trace 在高流量系统中成本不可承受。采样策略决定了数据质量与成本的平衡：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{Head Sampling&lt;br/&gt;SDK 层}&#10;    B --&gt;|采样| C[完整 trace 发送]&#10;    B --&gt;|丢弃| D[不产生数据]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Collector Gateway]&#10;    E --&gt; F{Tail Sampling&lt;br/&gt;Collector 层}&#10;    F --&gt;|保留: 错误/慢/特定用户| G[存储]&#10;    F --&gt;|丢弃: 正常快速请求| H[Drop]\">graph LR\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{Head Sampling&lt;br/&gt;SDK 层}\n    B --&gt;|采样| C[完整 trace 发送]\n    B --&gt;|丢弃| D[不产生数据]\n    C --&gt; E[Collector Gateway]\n    E --&gt; F{Tail Sampling&lt;br/&gt;Collector 层}\n    F --&gt;|保留: 错误/慢/特定用户| G[存储]\n    F --&gt;|丢弃: 正常快速请求| H[Drop]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Head Sampling</strong>：在 SDK 层做概率决策（如 10% 采样率），简单高效但可能丢失有价值的错误 trace</li>\n<li><strong>Tail Sampling</strong>：在 Collector Gateway 层，等待 trace 的所有 span 到齐后再决策——可按 latency &gt; 500ms、status = ERROR、特定 attribute 保留</li>\n<li><strong>混合策略</strong>（推荐）：Head 采 100% 但标记 <code>deferred</code>，Gateway 做 tail 决策。2026 年 OTel 引入动态采样策略，可结合 OPA 策略引擎根据请求属性、SLA 层级实时调整</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"otel-arrow-高效传输协议\">OTel-Arrow：高效传输协议</h2><p>2026 年 6 月 OTel-Arrow 进入 Phase 2——从高效传输协议升级为高效遥测管道。基于 Apache Arrow 的列式内存格式，在 Collector 内部也使用 Arrow 做处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>传输带宽较标准 OTLP/protobuf 减少 55–70%</li>\n<li>Collector 内部处理零拷贝，减少 GC 压力</li>\n<li>特别适合高基数 metric 和大批量 span 场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"语义约定-dashboard-的稳定基石\">语义约定：Dashboard 的稳定基石</h2><p>语义约定 v1 锁定意味着属性名不再漂移，Dashboard 终于可以跨服务复用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n<th>示例值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td><code>http.request.method</code>, <code>http.response.status_code</code>, <code>url.path</code></td>\n<td><code>GET</code>, <code>200</code>, <code>/api/orders</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Database</td>\n<td><code>db.system.name</code>, <code>db.query.text</code>, <code>db.operation.name</code></td>\n<td><code>postgresql</code>, <code>SELECT...</code>, <code>findAll</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Messaging</td>\n<td><code>messaging.system</code>, <code>messaging.operation.type</code>, <code>messaging.destination.name</code></td>\n<td><code>kafka</code>, <code>publish</code>, <code>order-events</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RPC</td>\n<td><code>rpc.system</code>, <code>rpc.method</code>, <code>rpc.service</code></td>\n<td><code>grpc</code>, <code>GetUser</code>, <code>UserService</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GenAI</td>\n<td><code>gen_ai.request.model</code>, <code>gen_ai.usage.input_tokens</code>, <code>gen_ai.usage.output_tokens</code></td>\n<td><code>gpt-4o</code>, <code>1200</code>, <code>350</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见落地陷阱\">常见落地陷阱</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>解法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包装 OTel API</td>\n<td>团队写了 <code>IMetric</code> 接口封装 OTel</td>\n<td>不要包装——OTel API 本身就是稳定抽象层，包装只增加维护成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDK 版本不一致</td>\n<td>服务间 trace context 格式不兼容</td>\n<td>统一依赖版本；声明式配置确保行为一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略 Resource 配置</td>\n<td>所有 span 的 <code>service.name</code> 为 <code>unknown_service</code></td>\n<td>在 otel-config.yaml 或环境变量中显式设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前端 SDK 阻塞主线程</td>\n<td>遥测代码导致 INP 劣化</td>\n<td>使用 <code>sendBeacon</code> / <code>fetch keepalive</code>，batch 在 <code>requestIdleCallback</code> 中执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于三支柱如何在 Collector 中实现交叉关联，参见 <a href=\"three-pillars-integration\">三支柱统一与关联</a>。将 OTel 融入开发流程的方法论，参见 <a href=\"observability-driven-development\">可观测性驱动开发</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>OpenTelemetry 在 2026 年已从“可选项”变为事实标准：OTLP 是唯一需要关注的传输协议，语义约定 v1 锁定让 Dashboard 得以跨服务复用，声明式配置终结了环境变量地狱。落地的核心决策有三：接入方式（优先零代码的 Agent / otelc 编译时插桩）、Collector 部署模式（Agent + Gateway 分层）、采样策略（Head 标记 + Tail 决策的混合方案）。最重要的反模式是包装 OTel API——它本身就是稳定抽象层，再包一层只增加维护成本。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenTelemetry 落地实践","id":"opentelemetry-落地实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OTel 架构全景","id":"otel-架构全景"},{"level":2,"text":"声明式配置：告别环境变量地狱","id":"声明式配置-告别环境变量地狱"},{"level":2,"text":"多语言接入策略","id":"多语言接入策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Collector 部署模式","id":"collector-部署模式"},{"level":2,"text":"采样策略：Head vs Tail vs 混合","id":"采样策略-head-vs-tail-vs-混合"},{"level":2,"text":"OTel-Arrow：高效传输协议","id":"otel-arrow-高效传输协议"},{"level":2,"text":"语义约定：Dashboard 的稳定基石","id":"语义约定-dashboard-的稳定基石"},{"level":2,"text":"常见落地陷阱","id":"常见落地陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"三支柱统一与关联","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/foundations/three-pillars-integration"},"next":{"title":"可观测性驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/foundations/observability-driven-development"}}